sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR/Manager
    participant View as "Web View (admin.attendance.index - tab today)"
    participant C as AttendanceController
    participant W as "Worker Model"
    participant A as "Attendance Model"
    participant LR as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka halaman Absensi Hari Ini
    View->>C: GET /admin/attendance?tab=today&attendance_date=...

    C->>W: Ambil semua pegawai aktif + relasi shift/department
    W->>DB: SELECT workers + relasi
    DB-->>W: Data workers

    C->>A: Ambil absensi pada tanggal terpilih
    A->>DB: SELECT attendances WHERE attendance_date = selectedDate
    DB-->>A: Data attendance hari ini

    C->>LR: Ambil leave approved pada tanggal terpilih
    LR->>DB: SELECT leave_requests approved per worker
    DB-->>LR: Data leave

    alt Data valid
        C-->>View: Render status hari ini (hadir/terlambat/cuti/libur/belum absen)
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan tabel absensi hari ini + ringkasan
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect/back + pesan error
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan error
    end
